title: A file in view, the window made smaller, minimized and restored: the same file stays selected and in view
folders: git-changes
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
left search
goto src/steps.rs
wait 1300
mark a-file-in-view
wait 500
resize 1000 640
wait 900
mark b-smaller
wait 500
minimize
wait 800
restore
wait 900
mark c-restored
wait 500
minimize
wait 800
restore
wait 900
mark d-restored-again
wait 500
quit
